			"fileName": "CartClient.tsx",
			"wiki": "The `addToCart` function is executed. It calls `setCart` with a function that receives the previous state (`prev`). It checks if the product already exists. If not, it returns a new array with the new product added (quantity 1). If it exists, it maps over the array and returns a new array with the quantity of the existing product incremented.",
