			"description": "<ul><li>The application displays a list of available products for users to browse</li><li>This is the primary function of the storefront</li><li>- Product data is defined in a static array on the server</li><li>- A Next</li><li>js server action (<code>getProducts</code>) retrieves this data</li><li>- The main page (<code>HomePage</code>) fetches the products during server-side rendering for a fast initial load</li><li>- The product list, including name, description, and price, is then passed to the <code>CartClient</code> component for display</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
