			"description": "<ul><li>This feature allows users to select products they wish to purchase</li><li>- Each product in the catalog has an Add to cart button</li><li>- Clicking the button triggers the <code>addToCart</code> function</li><li>- If the product is not already in the cart, it's added with a quantity of 1</li><li>- If the product is already in the cart, its quantity is incremented</li><li>- The cart's state is managed on the client side using React's <code>useState</code> hook</li></ul>",
