			"description": "<ul><li>Users can view a real-time summary of the items they have selected</li><li>- A dedicated Cart section on the page displays all items currently in the cart</li><li>- For each item, it shows the product name, the quantity selected, and the calculated subtotal for that item</li><li>- If no items have been added, a message Your cart is empty</li><li>is displayed</li><li>- The view updates instantly whenever an item is added, removed, or has its quantity changed</li></ul>",
